-- 1092: Blog post — Free premium AI subscriptions for Singaporeans from H2 2026
-- SG-only (CTAs are SG WSQ/SkillsFuture courses). Published immediately (status=1).
-- All CTA URLs verified HTTP 200 on 2026-08-24.

-- @mms_instance is pre-set by apply.php from MMS_COUNTRY_CODE (defaults to 'SG').
